To record the script in playwright by codegen
1. npx playwright codegen - enables record tool along with browser
2. npx playwright codegen -o tests/myTest.spec.js (filename along with path) | record directly into the file.
3. npx playwright codegen --target languageName (java, javascript, typescript, python)
4. npx playwright codegen -b (webkit,firefox,chromium,chrome)
5. npx playwright codegen  --device  "iPhone 13" | directly record test on devices.
6. npx playwright codegen --device "XX" | give list of device supported by playwright.
7. npx playwright test  tests/myTest.spec.js --headed --project="Mobile Safari" | this run test on devices


